#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:95
msgid "Elektron pochta manzili"
msgstr "Email Address"

#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:96
msgid "So'rovni yo'naltirish to'g'risida javob yoki xabarnoma olish uchun"
msgstr "To receive a response or notification regarding the request"

#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:105
msgid "Telefon raqamingiz"
msgstr "Your Phone Number"

#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:112
msgid "Murojaatning hammualliflarini qo'shing"
msgstr "Add co-authors of the appeal"

#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:118 templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:229
#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:257
msgid "hammuallif"
msgstr "co-author"

#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:134 templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:245
msgid "O'chirish"
msgstr "Delete"

#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:142
msgid "Qo'shish"
msgstr "Add"

#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:152
msgid ""
"Biz sizning murojaatingizni ob'ektiv va har tomonlama ko'rib chiqish "
"maqsadida murojaat matnida siz tasvirlagan harakat, fakt yoki voqea joyining "
"manzilini ko'rsatish tavsiya etilayotganiga e'tiboringizni qaratamiz."
msgstr ""
"We draw your attention to the recommendation to indicate the address of the "
"action, fact, or event described in your appeal text for an objective and "
"comprehensive review."

#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:153
msgid ""
"Agar murojaatingiz matni taklif, ariza yoki shikoyatning mohiyatini "
"aniqlashga imkon bermasa, murojaatga javob berilmaydi va u o'z vakolatiga "
"muvofiq davlat organiga, mahalliy davlat hokimiyati organiga yoki mansabdor "
"shaxsga ko'rib chiqishga yuborilmaydi, bu haqda sizga ma'lumot beriladi. "
"Apellyatsiya ro'yxatdan o'tgan kundan boshlab yetti kun ichida."
msgstr ""
"If the text of your appeal does not allow determining the essence of the "
"proposal, application, or complaint, no response will be provided, and it "
"will not be forwarded to the relevant state body, local government "
"authority, or official for consideration; you will be informed about this "
"within seven days from the registration date."

#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:154
msgid ""
"Taklif, bayonot yoki shikoyatning mohiyatini bayon qilish uchun "
"murojaatnomaning matnini elektron hujjat shaklida kiritish uchun maydonga "
"kiritilgan belgilar soniga cheklov qo'yilmaydi."
msgstr ""
"There is no limit on the number of characters entered in the field for "
"submitting the text of the appeal in electronic document form to describe "
"the essence of the proposal, statement, or complaint."

#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:159
msgid ""
"Murojaatnomangizni elektron hujjat shaklida kiritish uchun joriy maydonda "
"taklif, ariza yoki shikoyatning mohiyatini aytib bering:"
msgstr ""
"To submit your appeal in electronic document form, describe the essence of "
"the proposal, application, or complaint in this field:"

#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:162
msgid "Murojaat matni"
msgstr "Appeal Text"

#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:173
msgid ""
"Agar kerak bo'lsa, sizning dalillaringizni qo'llab-quvvatlash uchun siz "
"\"Hujjatlarni (fayllarni) biriktirish\" funktsiyasidan foydalangan holda "
"kerakli hujjatlar va materiallarni elektron shaklda apellyatsiyaga "
"qo'shishingiz mumkin."
msgstr ""
"If necessary, you can attach the required documents and materials in "
"electronic form to the appeal using the 'Attach Documents (Files)' function "
"to support your arguments."

#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:174
msgid ""
"Sizning e'tiboringizni veb-saytda taklif qilingan shaklda ilova qilingan "
"hujjatlar va materiallar faqat siz aytgan taklif, bayonot yoki shikoyatning "
"mohiyatini tasdiqlashiga qaratamiz."
msgstr ""
"We draw your attention to the fact that documents and materials attached in "
"the proposed form on the website are intended only to confirm the essence of "
"the proposal, statement, or complaint you mentioned."

#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:175
msgid ""
"Siz kerakli hujjatlar va materiallarni arxivlashsiz (ilova fayli), qabul "
"qilinadigan formatsiz ikkita mustaqil fayl qo'shimchalari bilan istalgan "
"tartibda elektron shaklda biriktirishingiz mumkin:"
msgstr ""
"You can attach the necessary documents and materials in electronic form "
"without archiving (attachment file), in any order, with two independent file "
"attachments in acceptable formats:"

#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:177
msgid ""
"txt, doc, docx, rtf, xls, xlsx, pps, ppt, odt, ods, odp, pub, pdf, jpg, "
"jpeg, bmp, png, tif, gif, pcx, mp3, wma, avi, mp4, mkv, wmv, mov, flv, "
"torrent, xml, zip, svg, rar"
msgstr ""
"txt, doc, docx, rtf, xls, xlsx, pps, ppt, odt, ods, odp, pub, pdf, jpg, "
"jpeg, bmp, png, tif, gif, pcx, mp3, wma, avi, mp4, mkv, wmv, mov, flv, "
"torrent, xml, zip, svg, rar"

#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:178
msgid ""
"Qo'shimcha fayl (lar) ning pochta serveriga uzatilishi foydalanuvchining "
"\"Internet\" tarmog'ining o'tkazuvchanlik qobiliyatiga va internet "
"provayderi serveri tomonidan qayta ishlangan uzatilgan fayllar hajmiga "
"bog'liqligini sizga ma'lum qilamiz."
msgstr ""
"We inform you that the transfer of additional file(s) to the mail server "
"depends on the bandwidth capacity of the user's 'Internet' network and the "
"volume of transferred files processed by the internet provider's server."

#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:180
msgid ""
"Sizning qurilma jihozingiz ADSL, 3G, 4G, WiFi va boshqa texnologiyalar "
"yordamida Internetdagi ma'lumotlarni uzatish tezligini ta'minlaydigan, "
"ajratilgan aloqa kanallari orqali Internetga ulanganda, fayl (lar) ning "
"umumiy hajmini uzatish va qayta ishlash:"
msgstr ""
"When your device is connected to the Internet via dedicated communication "
"channels providing data transfer speed using ADSL, 3G, 4G, WiFi, and other "
"technologies, the transfer and processing of the total file(s) size:"

#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:182
msgid "5 Mbgacha, qoida tariqasida, vaqtni kechiktirmasdan amalga oshiriladi;"
msgstr "Up to 5 MB, as a rule, is carried out without delay;"

#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:183
msgid ""
"5 Mb dan 10 Mb gacha bo'lgan fayllar, vaqtni kechiktirish bilan amalga "
"oshirish mumkin;"
msgstr "Files from 5 MB to 10 MB can be processed with a delay;"

#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:184
msgid "10 MB dan ortiq dastur amalga oshirilmasligi mumkin."
msgstr "Files exceeding 10 MB may not be processed."

#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:192
msgid ""
"Murojaatga kerakli hujjatlar va materiallarni elektron shaklda qo'shish "
"uchun \"Fayl(lar) biriktirish\" tugmani bosing"
msgstr ""
"To add necessary documents and materials to the appeal in electronic form, "
"click the 'Attach File(s)' button"

#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:197
msgid "Fayl(lar) biriktirish"
msgstr "Attach File(s)"

#: templates/pages/murojaatlar.html:197
msgid "Faylning umumiy hajmi 10 MB dan oshmasligi kerak"
msgstr "The total file size must not exceed 10 MB"

